@startuml 04_project_state
!include _style.iuml
title Prastav - Project status machine with guards
hide empty description

[*] --> DRAFT : createProject\n[actor is STUDENT, v1 draft created]
DRAFT --> SUBMITTED : submit\n[actor is owner, open draft, required fields filled]
SUBMITTED --> UNDER_REVIEW : assignReviewer\n[actor is COORDINATOR, assignee has FACULTY role]
UNDER_REVIEW --> APPROVED : approve\n[actor is assigned FACULTY reviewer]
UNDER_REVIEW --> REVISION_REQUESTED : requestRevision\n[assigned FACULTY reviewer, comments mandatory]
UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED : reject\n[assigned FACULTY reviewer, comments mandatory]
UNDER_REVIEW --> UNDER_REVIEW : reassignReviewer\n[actor is COORDINATOR, new reviewer has FACULTY role and is not the current one]
REVISION_REQUESTED --> UNDER_REVIEW : submit (resubmit)\n[actor is owner, open draft vN+1, required fields filled, reviewer set]
APPROVED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]

state DRAFT : allowed SUBMIT, EDIT_DRAFT
state SUBMITTED : allowed ASSIGN_REVIEWER
state UNDER_REVIEW : allowed APPROVE, REQUEST_REVISION, REJECT, REASSIGN_REVIEWER
state REVISION_REQUESTED : allowed CREATE_REVISION, EDIT_DRAFT, SUBMIT
state APPROVED : terminal
state REJECTED : terminal

note as N1
  Any action not on an arrow throws IllegalTransitionException (409 ILLEGAL_TRANSITION).
  Guard failures: 403 FORBIDDEN (who), 400 VALIDATION_FAILED (comments, fields, assignee role), 409 ILLEGAL_TRANSITION (no open draft, no reviewer).
end note
@enduml
